# Citation metadata. GitHub reads this file and renders a "Cite this repository"
# button from it.
#
# There is no paper and no DOI. Citing this repository cites software, not a
# validated clinical result: none of the three trained models has regulatory
# clearance or prospective validation, and the numbers reported in the model
# cards come from small held-out splits (three test cases for CCTA). Cite it as
# a research prototype.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CardioVision AI"
abstract: >-
  A locally deployed cardiovascular AI workstation combining echocardiography
  segmentation, CCTA coronary lumen segmentation, 12-lead ECG classification and
  a deterministic cross-modal evidence layer with MedGemma-generated narrative.
  Research prototype; not for clinical use.
type: software
version: "4.0.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/0mehedihasan/CardioVision-AI"
url: "https://github.com/0mehedihasan/CardioVision-AI"
authors:
  - family-names: "Hasan"
    given-names: "Md. Mehedi"
    affiliation: >-
      Advanced Machine Intelligence Research Lab (AMIR Lab), Department of
      Computer Science and Engineering, Bangladesh University of Business and
      Technology (BUBT), Dhaka, Bangladesh
keywords:
  - medical-imaging
  - echocardiography
  - computed-tomography-angiography
  - electrocardiography
  - segmentation
  - deep-learning
  - explainable-ai
